  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-13986705" data-guid="13986705"></div>
        <div id="questions-13986705" data-guid="13986705" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="13986705_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Added at referendum <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">11-7-2006</span></span>]</div><div class="para">The Common Council in consultation with the Chief Fiscal Officer and Mayor shall establish by resolution and review periodically a policy for determining appropriate levels of debt.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
